WEBVTT

00:00:35.540 --> 00:00:37.700
Yes. Exactly as you say.

00:00:38.830 --> 00:00:39.830
Nin!

00:02:36.410 --> 00:02:38.790
Seems he died of an illness.

00:02:38.790 --> 00:02:42.450
To go before fulfilling
his ambitions... How unfortunate.

00:02:42.450 --> 00:02:44.830
Of course, he was actually murdered.

00:02:47.370 --> 00:02:50.290
Yesterday, in response to the sudden
death of Representative Smith...

00:02:50.290 --> 00:02:53.200
...Representative Carver, who has been
working on developing Outside,

00:02:53.200 --> 00:02:55.750
gave this comment.

00:02:55.750 --> 00:03:00.330
In order to continue creating the Libra City
that Representative Smith dreamed of,

00:03:00.330 --> 00:03:04.250
I will personally take over his committee
and carry out his plans in his place.

00:03:04.250 --> 00:03:07.160
I promise to turn the crime-ridden Outside

00:03:07.160 --> 00:03:10.500
into an area where anyone can walk safely.

00:03:15.830 --> 00:03:20.870
We have been extremely satisfied
with the quality of your work.

00:03:22.290 --> 00:03:23.700
Nin.

00:03:23.700 --> 00:03:25.580
There is one more target.

00:03:25.580 --> 00:03:28.950
We are waiting in anticipation for
the completion of this request.

00:03:34.000 --> 00:03:37.160
Do you sense it? The stench of evil.

00:03:37.160 --> 00:03:39.370
It is getting stronger day by day.

00:03:39.370 --> 00:03:43.580
The winds only seem to carry
malice here from the other side.

00:03:43.580 --> 00:03:46.750
They are in need of our strength.

00:03:46.750 --> 00:03:49.410
You're going to save them all?

00:03:49.410 --> 00:03:52.040
The two of you won't be enough.

00:03:52.040 --> 00:03:54.000
You are here, too.

00:03:54.000 --> 00:03:55.580
I'll pass.

00:03:55.580 --> 00:04:01.160
To begin with, the fairy tale that we
could become human if we saved humans...

00:04:01.160 --> 00:04:02.750
Who started it?

00:04:17.500 --> 00:04:19.750
Belo, help us today, too.

00:04:19.750 --> 00:04:22.000
They came into our turf this time!

00:04:22.000 --> 00:04:24.250
Take them down again.

00:04:24.250 --> 00:04:26.450
Hey, Belo. You better be prepared!

00:04:26.450 --> 00:04:27.910
We're here to get revenge.

00:04:27.910 --> 00:04:29.500
You guys are finished.

00:04:29.500 --> 00:04:33.250
Starting today, this'll be our turf!

00:04:35.160 --> 00:04:36.200
So uncool.

00:04:36.200 --> 00:04:38.750
We even got a new member.

00:04:38.750 --> 00:04:41.330
Our secret weapon is amazing.

00:04:48.120 --> 00:04:49.700
What's with the snob?

00:04:49.700 --> 00:04:51.750
Is he strong?

00:04:53.950 --> 00:04:56.750
He's won a bunch of different tournaments.

00:04:56.750 --> 00:04:59.870
No matter how hard you try,
you won't hold a candle against him!

00:04:59.870 --> 00:05:01.830
Silence.

00:05:01.830 --> 00:05:05.250
I just wanted to fight a strong opponent.

00:05:05.250 --> 00:05:07.660
That's enough talking.

00:05:07.660 --> 00:05:09.950
Duels are a holy thing.

00:05:13.370 --> 00:05:15.700
My name is Daryl Bryson.

00:05:15.700 --> 00:05:18.000
Since I was hired to represent the team,

00:05:18.000 --> 00:05:22.080
it is my duty to go all-out and win.

00:05:26.410 --> 00:05:29.450
Take those off. How rude.

00:05:33.540 --> 00:05:35.910
The difficulty will be Double X!

00:05:35.910 --> 00:05:38.580
Super, super, super, super hard mode!

00:05:38.580 --> 00:05:40.410
Ready...?

00:05:40.410 --> 00:05:41.580
Go!

00:05:51.160 --> 00:05:52.660
Go, go!

00:05:56.660 --> 00:05:59.200
No way. He's even with Belo!

00:05:59.200 --> 00:06:00.620
He might lose...

00:06:00.620 --> 00:06:03.080
Go! Go! Go! Go!

00:06:03.080 --> 00:06:04.660
Belo! Do your best!

00:06:04.660 --> 00:06:05.830
Do it, Daryl!

00:06:05.830 --> 00:06:09.290
As expected! Crush him!

00:06:09.290 --> 00:06:11.660
This is bad! This is bad! Really bad!

00:06:38.290 --> 00:06:40.250
Wh-What?!

00:06:45.870 --> 00:06:47.580
Useless!

00:06:47.580 --> 00:06:49.120
Belo!

00:06:51.120 --> 00:06:54.370
Belo! Thank you!

00:06:51.120 --> 00:06:54.370
Seriously?!

00:06:54.370 --> 00:06:55.750
H-Hey!

00:06:55.750 --> 00:06:57.700
We win. Get out!

00:06:57.700 --> 00:07:01.040
That's right! Don't ever come here again!

00:07:01.040 --> 00:07:02.200
Hey, Daryl!

00:07:02.200 --> 00:07:03.660
And you call yourself a champion?!

00:07:03.660 --> 00:07:05.410
Don't ever show your face to me again!

00:07:05.410 --> 00:07:08.120
The hell?! You had an expression
like you'd win for sure!

00:07:08.120 --> 00:07:10.250
Hey! You listening?! Hey!

00:07:13.580 --> 00:07:16.200
You weren't serious in the beginning.

00:07:16.200 --> 00:07:19.370
To fight while ignoring the opponent
is looking down on them.

00:07:19.370 --> 00:07:22.080
And it's an insult to the game.

00:07:22.080 --> 00:07:24.330
It's how I always play.

00:07:24.330 --> 00:07:27.830
That's not an answer. Listen, I'm strong.

00:07:27.830 --> 00:07:31.080
There's no one stronger than me in Upper.

00:07:31.080 --> 00:07:36.540
That's why I came. I wanted to find
someone I could play seriously against.

00:07:36.540 --> 00:07:38.040
How suffocating...

00:07:38.040 --> 00:07:41.080
I want to play against you
when you're serious from the start.

00:07:41.080 --> 00:07:44.250
It's disrespectful to the game
if you're not serious!

00:07:44.250 --> 00:07:47.660
Come. Let us have our
second round at my house.

00:07:47.660 --> 00:07:49.040
I don't like that side.

00:07:49.040 --> 00:07:50.790
No, I'll have you come with me.

00:07:50.790 --> 00:07:52.750
I'll win in the end, anyway.

00:07:52.750 --> 00:07:55.080
We won't know until we try.

00:07:55.080 --> 00:07:58.290
I won't lose. There is no way I'd lose!

00:07:59.910 --> 00:08:02.580
You don't know what I'm like
when I am serious.

00:08:02.580 --> 00:08:04.370
I have accepted you!

00:08:04.370 --> 00:08:07.830
We must have the greatest of duels
on a level that is befitting for us!

00:08:07.830 --> 00:08:10.040
Come.

00:08:10.040 --> 00:08:12.160
Well... Fine...

00:08:30.290 --> 00:08:33.250
Your father has already returned.

00:08:33.250 --> 00:08:35.040
Representative Carver is with him.

00:08:35.040 --> 00:08:37.580
Really? You should have said so sooner!

00:08:46.200 --> 00:08:47.910
Allow me to introduce my father.

00:09:03.830 --> 00:09:07.200
I hope you understand my skill now.

00:09:07.200 --> 00:09:08.500
This way.

00:09:09.500 --> 00:09:12.580
Father. I have brought a friend.

00:09:12.580 --> 00:09:15.160
Oh, welcome home. Hello.

00:09:16.290 --> 00:09:18.450
Hello, Daryl.

00:09:18.450 --> 00:09:20.870
Good evening, sir.

00:09:20.870 --> 00:09:23.040
That gentleman is Representative Carter.

00:09:23.040 --> 00:09:25.830
My father is his secretary and bodyguard.

00:09:29.410 --> 00:09:32.040
It has been a long time since
you've come to play here.

00:09:32.040 --> 00:09:35.950
Well, I must work hard for Mr. Smith.

00:09:35.950 --> 00:09:38.160
But an occasional break is nice.

00:09:38.160 --> 00:09:43.540
It is our duty to make Libra City a place
where people can live in ease.

00:09:43.540 --> 00:09:45.790
What do you mean by that?

00:09:45.790 --> 00:09:48.750
Of course, a place where people
don't have to worry about tomorrow--

00:09:48.750 --> 00:09:50.080
That's impossible.

00:09:51.750 --> 00:09:53.120
That's what everyone says.

00:09:53.120 --> 00:09:56.290
However, there is no reason
to think that it is impossible.

00:09:56.290 --> 00:09:58.660
Everyone has merely given up.

00:09:58.660 --> 00:10:01.500
I will make sure that Outside is purified.

00:10:01.500 --> 00:10:02.790
Exactly!

00:10:02.790 --> 00:10:06.290
Representative Carver is
going to create a new future.

00:10:06.290 --> 00:10:08.040
You're so pure.

00:10:08.040 --> 00:10:11.370
Hey, don't speak so rudely towards him!

00:10:11.370 --> 00:10:12.870
Stop.

00:10:13.910 --> 00:10:16.370
Thank you for your valuable opinion.

00:10:24.160 --> 00:10:26.200
Why are you so strong?!

00:10:26.200 --> 00:10:30.330
Are you sure this is the first time you've
played this game?! Extraordinary!

00:10:36.330 --> 00:10:38.160
Oh, hey. Belo!

00:10:39.950 --> 00:10:42.330
Let us go and inspect Outside.

00:10:42.330 --> 00:10:46.160
I want to know how strong
the anti-social forces are.

00:10:46.160 --> 00:10:48.540
It is still too early, sir.

00:10:48.540 --> 00:10:52.040
Even as a performance, it's too dangerous.

00:10:52.040 --> 00:10:54.500
We can't do things leisurely.

00:10:54.500 --> 00:10:57.750
We must show a fearless attitude.

00:11:01.410 --> 00:11:02.410
You!

00:11:21.120 --> 00:11:22.870
Thanks to you...

00:11:27.290 --> 00:11:29.370
Representative Carver has been attacked.

00:11:29.370 --> 00:11:34.410
According to the tests, a toxic dose
of aconitine was found in his wine.

00:11:34.410 --> 00:11:38.290
It is a lethal poison that can
be extracted from monkshood.

00:11:38.290 --> 00:11:41.790
I have heard that Representative Smith
had been threatened many times.

00:11:41.790 --> 00:11:47.330
This was a challenge from the forces
against the purification of the city!

00:11:47.330 --> 00:11:52.910
According to the claims of
Representative Carver, the culprits...

00:11:47.330 --> 00:11:48.830
How scary!

00:11:48.830 --> 00:11:52.910
I wonder if Carver is going
to die from an illness, too.

00:12:01.200 --> 00:12:03.200
It's been a while, Sonia.

00:12:03.200 --> 00:12:06.410
I saw the news. Are you all right?

00:12:06.410 --> 00:12:08.580
That was just a performance.

00:12:08.580 --> 00:12:10.790
This is for you, too.

00:12:10.790 --> 00:12:11.830
Huh?!

00:12:11.830 --> 00:12:14.080
You picked a fight with them.

00:12:14.080 --> 00:12:16.910
And now you're there because you lost.

00:12:18.000 --> 00:12:19.790
That's true...

00:12:19.790 --> 00:12:23.830
Will you come out?
I'd like to hear about that side.

00:12:34.910 --> 00:12:36.580
Nin.

00:12:36.580 --> 00:12:38.250
How disappointing.

00:12:38.250 --> 00:12:39.910
To think you would fail.

00:12:39.910 --> 00:12:40.870
Nin.

00:12:40.870 --> 00:12:43.700
We no longer care if you do it openly.

00:12:43.700 --> 00:12:46.500
We only wish for results.

00:12:46.500 --> 00:12:48.080
Nin.

00:12:48.080 --> 00:12:51.160
I hear a young boy stopped you.

00:12:51.160 --> 00:12:52.160
Nin.

00:12:52.160 --> 00:12:55.410
His skills were that of a trained man.

00:12:55.410 --> 00:12:56.950
How interesting...

00:13:04.330 --> 00:13:07.000
Where did you meet that child?

00:13:07.000 --> 00:13:09.080
In Outside.

00:13:09.080 --> 00:13:11.750
Don't bring him here again.

00:13:11.750 --> 00:13:14.120
Those movements were not normal.

00:13:14.120 --> 00:13:16.950
He may be a part of an assassin's group.

00:13:18.700 --> 00:13:22.160
It's not good to associate with
someone of an unknown background.

00:13:22.160 --> 00:13:24.580
Do not see him again.

00:13:24.580 --> 00:13:26.080
Yes...

00:13:28.450 --> 00:13:31.750
I don't like this side, after all.

00:13:31.750 --> 00:13:34.790
It's rare for you to make a friend in Upper.

00:13:38.660 --> 00:13:40.790
What's going on?

00:13:40.790 --> 00:13:43.290
Are you thinking about something?

00:13:43.290 --> 00:13:44.700
Not really...

00:13:56.660 --> 00:13:58.080
Belo.

00:13:58.080 --> 00:14:00.040
That snob is here again.

00:14:01.370 --> 00:14:03.870
I thought you weren't supposed
to meet with me again.

00:14:03.870 --> 00:14:06.580
How did you know?

00:14:06.580 --> 00:14:09.830
Well, it's fine. That's just
what my father says.

00:14:09.830 --> 00:14:12.620
I don't think you are a bad person.

00:14:12.620 --> 00:14:13.950
What a weird guy.

00:14:13.950 --> 00:14:16.330
Why did you disappear?

00:14:16.330 --> 00:14:18.620
If you don't want to say, that's fine.

00:14:18.620 --> 00:14:21.330
I don't care who you are,

00:14:21.330 --> 00:14:24.540
but I need that strength of yours.

00:14:25.700 --> 00:14:28.790
I respect Mr. Carver very much.

00:14:28.790 --> 00:14:31.000
It will take many years before his ideals

00:14:31.000 --> 00:14:33.540
become a reality.

00:14:33.540 --> 00:14:36.000
Someday I want to inherit that work.

00:14:36.000 --> 00:14:38.870
When that time comes, I want your help.

00:14:40.790 --> 00:14:43.750
That kind of thing will happen many times.

00:14:43.750 --> 00:14:46.870
Please fight by my side!

00:14:46.870 --> 00:14:50.450
What the hell are you saying...

00:14:46.870 --> 00:14:50.450
It has to be you!

00:14:50.450 --> 00:14:52.910
Come and play games at my house again.

00:15:11.000 --> 00:15:12.830
Mr. Bryson.

00:15:13.910 --> 00:15:17.120
You are Mr. Carver's dear friend...

00:15:18.200 --> 00:15:20.200
It was a single moment.

00:15:20.200 --> 00:15:24.250
In that moment,
a black shadow jumped out...

00:15:33.370 --> 00:15:35.200
It's still not over.

00:15:36.580 --> 00:15:42.040
The sneakier their tactics,
the stronger our bonds.

00:15:42.040 --> 00:15:47.450
Smith. Carver. There are many
who would inherit their will.

00:15:48.620 --> 00:15:51.290
What will you do, Father?

00:15:51.290 --> 00:15:53.200
I am going to the committee.

00:15:53.200 --> 00:15:56.450
We must regain our footing.

00:15:56.450 --> 00:15:59.750
He would be sad if we spent
all our time in tears.

00:15:59.750 --> 00:16:02.500
Let me help. I want to learn.

00:16:02.500 --> 00:16:04.330
It's still too early for you.

00:16:04.330 --> 00:16:07.040
There is no early or late in studying!

00:16:07.040 --> 00:16:08.910
Believe in me.

00:16:13.410 --> 00:16:16.290
You're so strong, Father.

00:16:23.330 --> 00:16:26.040
Everyone. My era is about to begin.

00:16:26.040 --> 00:16:28.120
Much faster than expected!

00:16:28.120 --> 00:16:31.410
Let us have a toast and give thanks.

00:16:31.410 --> 00:16:33.950
The "unseen council" that rules this city

00:16:33.950 --> 00:16:37.950
has removed two of our
valuable representatives.

00:16:37.950 --> 00:16:41.660
The development of Outside
will move according to my plans!

00:16:41.660 --> 00:16:45.330
First, we will send these
live bullets to the unseen council.

00:16:45.330 --> 00:16:48.160
We will slowly eat them from the inside

00:16:48.160 --> 00:16:50.950
and take all their power!

00:16:50.950 --> 00:16:53.540
I will make all of you rich.

00:16:53.540 --> 00:16:57.330
And the "unseen council" will be dragged

00:16:57.330 --> 00:17:01.700
out into the public and incur their wrath.

00:17:01.700 --> 00:17:05.370
The plans to make it a reality lie here.

00:17:05.370 --> 00:17:08.620
Cheers to Mr. Carver's death!

00:17:21.450 --> 00:17:24.120
You were quite showy.

00:17:24.120 --> 00:17:27.750
Nin. <i>You</i> removed the need for secrecy.

00:17:27.750 --> 00:17:30.040
We have additional targets.

00:17:30.040 --> 00:17:33.870
They are small fries that are
starting to get big heads.

00:17:40.750 --> 00:17:42.450
Where are you going, Belo?

00:17:42.450 --> 00:17:44.870
He's changed lately.

00:17:44.870 --> 00:17:46.000
Yeah...

00:17:46.000 --> 00:17:47.790
Is he planning on changing teams?

00:17:47.790 --> 00:17:49.000
Huh? No way!

00:17:49.000 --> 00:17:51.830
It'd be lonely without Belo.

00:17:51.830 --> 00:17:54.040
You're really interesting.

00:17:54.040 --> 00:17:55.790
I knew you would come.

00:17:55.790 --> 00:17:58.580
That's why I can depend on you.

00:17:58.580 --> 00:18:01.160
Why don't you take those headphones off?

00:18:01.160 --> 00:18:03.250
Who cares whether I wear them or not?

00:18:03.250 --> 00:18:05.120
What are you always listening to?

00:18:05.120 --> 00:18:06.120
Various things.

00:18:06.120 --> 00:18:08.410
Do you always wear them
when together with others?

00:18:08.410 --> 00:18:10.620
Don't you find that rude?

00:18:10.620 --> 00:18:11.910
Who knows...

00:18:11.910 --> 00:18:13.950
You're weird. Definitely weird.

00:18:13.950 --> 00:18:14.790
You, too.

00:18:14.790 --> 00:18:17.160
Me? How so? Tell me.

00:18:17.160 --> 00:18:18.540
Shut up.

00:18:24.000 --> 00:18:26.200
It's fine. Father is still...

00:18:26.200 --> 00:18:27.700
No, he has returned.

00:18:27.700 --> 00:18:29.750
Huh?

00:18:29.750 --> 00:18:30.540
H-Hey!

00:18:30.540 --> 00:18:32.580
Don't come! Wait there!

00:18:43.950 --> 00:18:45.080
You are?!

00:18:48.540 --> 00:18:49.620
Nin.

00:19:02.000 --> 00:19:03.000
Nin?!

00:19:15.870 --> 00:19:17.540
I'll kill you...

00:19:23.620 --> 00:19:24.620
Nin!

00:19:29.580 --> 00:19:31.290
Ni-Ni-Ni-Nin!

00:20:05.950 --> 00:20:07.410
Father!

00:20:11.660 --> 00:20:13.750
Belo...

00:20:13.750 --> 00:20:17.290
Was it you? Did you do this?!

00:20:17.290 --> 00:20:21.000
N-No. I would never...

00:20:18.950 --> 00:20:21.000
Then, what is that blood?!

00:20:21.000 --> 00:20:25.000
Why are you naked?! Why?!

00:20:25.000 --> 00:20:27.620
I-It wasn't me...

00:21:18.870 --> 00:21:21.450
Shadow was killed.

00:21:21.450 --> 00:21:24.160
Who was it? Water and Bowling, too.

00:21:24.160 --> 00:21:26.700
I heard they were killed
by something strange.

00:21:26.700 --> 00:21:32.200
Be careful. They may be watching us.

00:21:32.200 --> 00:21:33.830
How interesting.

00:21:33.830 --> 00:21:36.580
If there's something out there,
I'd liked to hunt it.

00:21:36.580 --> 00:21:40.790
The one who eliminated Shadow
has been confirmed as Gamma.

00:21:42.950 --> 00:21:45.080
We will continue our investigation.

00:21:57.830 --> 00:22:00.750
And he escapes to games again.

00:22:00.750 --> 00:22:03.620
Leave him alone.

00:22:03.620 --> 00:22:06.700
You understand the pain he feels.

00:22:10.250 --> 00:22:12.540
I don't need this kind of power.

00:22:12.540 --> 00:22:15.040
I want to hurry and become human.
